join Amos (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Amos (Warm)
- It's exactly the drawing
	Hope: It's exactly the drawing.
	Amos: Mm.
	Amos: Nineteen years I've been building for other people. Paths, pens, drainage, someone's wall, someone's roof.
	Amos: All of it needed doing. I'm not complaining about any of it.
	Amos: But you build a thing for somebody else and when it's finished you walk away from it. That's right. That's how it should be.
	Amos: This one I don't walk away from.
	Amos: That's the difference. Took me nine years to get an afternoon free and this is what I did with it.
- What will you use it for?
	Hope: What will you use it for?
	Amos: Sitting.
	Amos: Good light in the afternoon.
[signal arg="hearts:amos:3"]
set {GameState.amos_build_finished} = true
